Can't you just choose another name? The game should ask you for a name
first, and then check to see whether there are any save files with that
name.

Perhaps, in your .nethackrc (unix) or defaults.nh (dos/windows) file,
you have specified the name:Xxxxx option? If you did, you will never be
asked for your name, all your characters will hence have the same name,
and your save file will always be picked.

